Domestic template for non Michigan stations in MI QSO Party
The 13 Canadian provinces and territories are prov13.dom's, one multiplier each (the sponsor's NL, NB, NS, PE, QC, ON, MB, SK, AB, BC, NT, YT, NU).
DX is the one DX multiplier.
No line of this header may hold an equals sign: the reader takes any such line as an entry.

INCLUDE FILE S51.DOM
INCLUDE FILE MICHIGAN_CTY.DOM
Dx = DX

INCLUDE FILE prov13.dom